  "notes": "This is a past/latent condition report: the deficient seismic restraint existed from 2011-08-05 until corrected 2021-06-29, but was not discovered/reported until Paragon's Part 21 notification on 2021-06-28. No seismic event occurred during the vulnerability window. 'C' Chiller design was unaffected (different, unreplaced design) and remained operable; not modeled as a backup system per se since it is simply the third train unaffected by the defect, not a stated operability backup to the 'A' Chiller during its inoperability. No SIMILAR_TO edge emitted since narrative states no similar events were found in the 3-year LER/CR review."
